          "type": "button",
          "text": "Apply to my character",
          "help": "Gives your character the preset chosen above for their sex. It replaces the body sliders LooksMenu and BodyGen set, including ones you set in LooksMenu yourself; body morphs other mods add are left alone. Close the menu to see it.",
