          "type": "button",
          "text": "Reset",
          "help": "Forget the body you gave them: Silhouette decides again, as if they were met for the first time. A named character gets their own body back; someone a rule by name or faction covers draws again from that rule's presets -- a different one whenever the rule lists more than one -- and keeps the new draw; anyone else rolls a new body from the pool. Body morphs other mods keep under their own keyword (AAF, pregnancy) are kept. In the middle of an AAF scene it waits for the scene to end.",
